rtificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§3.3–3.4, pp. 64–68; scans 72–76"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，扩张转移见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\Sigma,p\\in Q\">\\(a\\in\\Sigma,p\\in Q\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}reachable\\text{-}states}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\coloneqq\\{\\widehat\\delta_M(q_0,w):w\\in\\Sigma^*\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}reachable\\text{-}states}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\coloneqq\\{\\widehat\\delta_M(q_0,w):w\\in\\Sigma^*\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}reachable\\text{-}states}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trim}(M)\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{Reach}(M),\\Sigma,\\delta\\!\\upharpoonright(\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\times\\Sigma),q_0,F\\cap\\operatorname{Reach}(M))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}reachable\\text{-}states}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trim}(M)\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{Reach}(M),\\Sigma,\\delta\\!\\upharpoonright(\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\times\\Sigma),q_0,F\\cap\\operatorname{Reach}(M))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}reachable\\text{-}states}\\vdash\nq_0\\in\\operatorname{Reach}(M),\\qquad p\\in\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\Longrightarrow\\delta(p,a)\\in\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}reachable\\text{-}states}\\vdash\nq_0\\in\\operatorname{Reach}(M),\\qquad p\\in\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\Longrightarrow\\delta(p,a)\\in\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可达部分包含初态且对转移封闭，故限制转移仍是全函数；删除的状态不会出现在任何从初态开始的运行中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}$，扩张转移见 [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]。$a\\in\\Sigma,p\\in Q$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\Sigma,p\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}reachable\\text{-}states}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\coloneqq\\{\\widehat\\delta_M(q_0,w):w\\in\\Sigma^*\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}reachable\\text{-}states}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trim}(M)\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{Reach}(M),\\Sigma,\\delta\\!\\upharpoonright(\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\times\\Sigma),q_0,F\\cap\\operatorname{Reach}(M))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dfa\\text{-}reachable\\text{-}states}\\vdash\nq_0\\in\\operatorname{Reach}(M),\\qquad p\\in\\operatorname{Reach}(M)\\Longrightarrow\\delta(p,a)\\in\\operatorname{Reach}(M)","display":true}],"bytes":1743,"backlinks":[{"id":"eaa557af281c04f0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}$。$[p]_M$ 与可达集分别见 [[73-df-dfa-state-distinguishability]]、[[73-df-dfa-reachable-states]]；$C\\in Q_{\\min},a\\in\\Sigma$。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-reachable-states|DFA 的可达部分]]"}],"outgoing":["3b7a967565c86f39"]}